@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Read and filter immutable audit events
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
actor "Administrator" as actor
box "Frontend - Mission Control application" #E0F2FE
  participant "AuditLogPage / AuditEventView" as page
  participant "IAuditEventService / AuditEventService" as client
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "CurrentAccountAuthorization" as access
  participant "AuditEventsController" as ctrl
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "ValidationBehavior" as validation
  participant "ListAuditEventsQueryHandler /\nListAuditActorsQueryHandler" as handler
  participant "AuditEvent" as entity
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  participant "IAuditEventWriter" as audit
  database "Mission Control SQL" as db
end box
== Actor combobox search ==
actor -> page : Type in Actor (for example "an")
page -> page : Debounce about 250 ms on the actor query signal
page -> client : actorChoicesResource(ListAuditActorsQuery { search, page 1, pageSize 25 }); a newer search aborts the older read
client -> access : GET /api/audit-events/actors (authorized as below)
access -> ctrl : Administrator request
ctrl -> handler : ListAuditActorsQuery through MediatR 12.5.0 and its validator (pageSize 1-100)
handler -> db : ListAuditActorsAsync: every account, inactive included; display name then ID; window total
alt Search answered
  db --> handler : ID and display name only
  handler --> client : 200 AuditActorPage
  client --> page : Listbox shows Anyone, then the matches; the match count is announced politely
  actor -> page : Pick a person, or Anyone to clear the filter
else 500 or no response
  handler --> client : Generic 500 with correlation ID, or no response
  client --> page : actorChoices status error: Actor shows a field message with the reference ID (when there is one) and Retry = reload(); the alert is announced; the actor filter, other filters and rows stay (actor-failed)
end

== Read and filter events ==
actor -> page : Open /audit or change a filter or page (the page's refresh input rereads with the same filters)
page -> page : Reset to page 1 on filter change; show loading skeleton
page -> client : Query signal changes (actor, area, outcome, Toronto dates, page); auditEventsResource aborts any superseded read
client -> access : GET /api/audit-events
access -> access : L2-002 validate signature, issuer, audience, subject, expiry (zero clock skew)
access -> db : LoadAccountAccessAsync: current status, role and credential version
db --> access : Current account access
alt Missing, invalid or expired JWT; inactive or missing account; credential version changed
  access -> audit : AppendRestrictedAsync(Denied); no payload
  access --> client : 401
  client --> page : sessionInterceptor: end(Unauthorized) once for this generation; the read rejects with its 401; login opens (session-ended) with /audit to return to
else Authenticated Collaborator (L2-039: no audit.read)
  access -> audit : AppendRestrictedAsync(Denied); no payload
  access --> client : 403
  client --> page : refreshCapabilities() (deduplicated); AuditEventView emits forbidden; AuditLogPage calls inject(ApplicationShell).showStatus(AccessDenied); no audit data shown
else Administrator
  access -> ctrl : Authorized request
  ctrl -> validation : Send ListAuditEventsQuery through MediatR 12.5.0
  validation -> validation : L2-045 page size 1-100; known AuditOutcome and AuditArea; from not after to
  alt Invalid filter, date range or page size
    validation --> ctrl : 400 field errors; nothing read
    ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
    client --> page : Keep every filter and the rows already shown; mark the invalid filter (inverted range: To, "Choose a To date on or after Sep 30, 2026"; invalid-range state)
  else Valid request
    validation -> handler : Handle ListAuditEventsQuery
    handler -> handler : Convert Toronto dates to half-open UTC interval
    handler -> db : L2-039 bounded read of immutable event metadata; AND filters, area matched on the stored AuditArea; newest first, then ID
    db --> handler : Page of events and full matching count
    handler -> entity : Project timestamp, actor ID, operation, entity type and ID, outcome, correlation ID
    entity --> handler : Safe audit rows; no secret or contact payload
    handler --> ctrl : 200 with rows and total count
    ctrl --> client : Success response
    alt No matching events
      client --> page : filtered-zero state: announce 0 events; offer Clear filters (back to Anyone and all areas, outcomes and dates)
    else Events found
      client --> page : Update signals; announce the matching count
      page --> actor : Toronto time with UTC beneath; Unknown for events without an actor
    end
  end
end
note over ctrl, db
Unexpected failures return generic 500 plus correlation ID (L2-043);
the page shows its error state with Try again and that reference ID.
A read that gets no response shows the same state without a reference ID.
Viewing never changes the audit log; no edit or delete endpoint exists.
end note
@enduml
